4a:["$","p",null,{"children":["The route's second segment is the scheduler's ",["$","code",null,{"children":"name"}]," from the ",["$","code",null,{"children":"schedulers"}],"\nlist (",["$","code",null,{"children":"MAIN_SCHEDULER"}]," in the shipped configs), not the REAPI instance name,\nand the ",["$","code",null,{"children":"admin"}]," service has to be enabled on a listener for the route to\nexist at all. Nothing in the repository wires this up for you. It is a short\nscript, and it's the difference between a clean scale-in and a burst of\nretried actions."]}]
