54:["$","$L50",null,{"title":"Scale-in causes a burst of failed or retried actions","id":"scale-in-causes-a-burst-of-failed-or-retried-actions","children":["$","p",null,{"children":"Workers are being killed with work in flight. The drain endpoint exists for\nexactly this and nothing calls it automatically. Wire it to your platform's\npre-shutdown hook, and give the pod a termination grace period long enough for a\ntypical action to finish."}]}]
55:["$","$L50",null,{"title":"Two workers on one host behave erratically","id":"two-workers-on-one-host-behave-erratically","children":["$","p",null,{"children":["Check they do not share a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"work_directory"}],". The worker purges that directory at\nstartup, so a restart of one worker destroys the other's state. Each worker\nprocess needs its own."]}]}]
